{"id":"word:hebrew:H990","type":"word","title":"בֶּטֶן","subtitle":"H990 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"the belly , especially the womb ; also the bosom or body of anything","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בֶּטֶן (H990) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 72 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בֶּטֶן (beṭen) means the belly , especially the womb ; also the bosom or body of anything First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 7 20."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בֶּטֶן","transliteration":"beṭen","pronunciation":"beh'-ten","strong":"H990","lemmaId":"hebrew:H990","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["מִ/בֶּ֣טֶן","בָֽטֶן","מִ/בֶּ֖טֶן","בִטְנְ/ךָ֛","בְּ/בֶ֣טֶן"],"morphs":[["HR/Ncfsa",10],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",8],["HR/Ncfsc",8],["HNcfsa",8],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",7],["HTd/Ncfsa",4],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",4],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",4],["HRd/Ncfsa",3],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3fs",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"the belly , especially the womb ; also the bosom or body of anything","usage":"belly, body, as they be born, within, womb.","full":"H990. beten I. בֶ֫טֶן noun feminine Num 5:25 belly, body, womb (Arabic ) — ׳בּ absolute Judg 13:7 +; בָּ֑טֶן 13:5 +; construct בֶּטֶן Psa 139:13 +; suffix בִּטְנִי Job 3:10 +; בִּטְנְךָ Deut 7:13 +; בִּטְנֵךְ Gen 25:23 ; בִּטְנוֺ Job 15:2 +, etc.; — 1. a. belly, abdomen , of man Judg 3:21-22 , of woman Num 5:21-22 , 27 ; as beautiful in form Cant 7:3; as seat of hunger Prov 13:25 ; as eating Ezek 3:3 (|| מֵעִים ); compare Prov 18:20 (figurative); as seat of passion, avarice, etc. Job 20:20 , 23 ; in figure of God's casting riches out of extortioner's belly 20:15 (|| וַיְקִאֶנּוּ ), compare also Psa 17:14 ; figurative of innermost part of man = inmost soul Prov 18:8 = 26:22 ; 20:27 , 30 (all ב ׳חַדְרֵי ); as seat of intell. faculties (= English breast or bosom ) 22:18 (compare מֵעִים Psa 40:9 ) Job 15:2 ; 15:35 ; 32:18 , בִּטְנִי רוּחַ 15:19 ; as trembling at theophany Hab 3:16 . b. belly of hippopotamus Job 40:16 . c. שְׁאוֺל בֶּטֶן Jonah 2:3 (Jonah's prayer: || יַמִּים בִּלְבַכ מְצוּלָה ). 2 body , opposed to soul Psa 31:10 (opposed to נֶפֶשׁ ), also 44:26 (opposed to id. ; — on this compare Zim Bp 71 ). 3 womb Gen 25:23-24 , 38:27 (all J) Hosea 12:4 ; Job 10:19 (|| רֶחֶם 10:18 ) Eccl 11:5 ; Job 31:15 עָשָׂ֑הוּ עשֵֹׁנִי בַבֶּטֶן הֲלֹא did not he that made me in the womb make him (|| אֶחָד בָּרֶחֶם וַיְכֻנֶנּוּ ); compare Psa 139:13 בְּבֶטֶן תְּסֻכֵּנִי , & Jer 1:5 ; especially ב ׳מְּרִי i.e. offspring Gen 30:2 (E) Psa 127:3 ; Isa 13:18 ; Prov 31:2 בִּטְנִי בַּר = my son (|| בְּרִי ) compare בֶּןבִּֿטְנָהּ Isa 49:15 ; of birth מִבֶּטֶן יָצָא Job 1:21 ; 3:11 ; Eccl 5:14 ; בֶּטֶן alone = birth Hosea 9:11 (|| הֵרָיוֺן לֵדָה, ), compare Figurative הַקָּ֑רַח יָצָא מִי מִבֶּטֶן Job 38:29 out of whose womb came the ice ? compare בִּטְנִי דַּלְתֵי סָגַר לֹא 3:10 i.e. of my (mother's) womb ; מִבֶּטֶן גָּחָה take, draw out of the womb , subject ׳י (i.e. cause to be born) Psa 22:10 ; בֶטֶן מְּרִי used also of father Micah 6:7 , compare Psa 132:11 (David as ancestor of Messianic King); Job 19:17 בִטְנִי בְּנֵי sons of my body , of doubtful interpretation, perhaps = sons of my (mother's) womb , compare 3:10 (Ges De), i.e. my brother or men of my clan RS K 33 f. , others my sons (Ew), my grandsons (Di); also in addressing Israel As a whole (masculine suffix) Deut 7:13 ; 28:4 , 11 , 18 , 53 ; 30:9 , compare בִטְנָם מַחֲמַדֵּי Hosea 9:16 beloved ones of their womb ; מִןהַֿבֶּטֶן (מִבֶּטֶן) = from birth Judg 13:5 , 7 ; Psa 58:4 ; 71:6 , compare also Isa 44:2 , 24 ; 46:3 (|| רָחַ֑ם ) 48:8 ; 49:1 , 5 ; נִמִּי מִבֶּטֶן id. Judg 16:17 ; Job 31:18 ; Psa 22:11 (|| רֶחֶם ). 4 architectural word of some rounded projection connected with the two pillars Jachin & Boaz 1Kin 7:20 (Klo reads הבית ).","rootNote":"from an unused root probably meaning to be hollow;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 7 20","keyReferences":["1Kgs 7 20","Deut 7 13","Deut 28 4","Deut 28 11","Deut 28 18","Deut 28 53","Deut 30 9","Eccl 5 14"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":72,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 7 20","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בֶּ֔טֶן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Deut 7 13","book":"Deut","chapter":7,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִטְנְ/ךָ֣","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 28 4","book":"Deut","chapter":28,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִטְנְ/ךָ֛","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 28 11","book":"Deut","chapter":28,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִטְנְ/ךָ֛","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 28 18","book":"Deut","chapter":28,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִטְנְ/ךָ֖","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 28 53","book":"Deut","chapter":28,"verse":53,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִטְנְ/ךָ֗","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 30 9","book":"Deut","chapter":30,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִטְנְ/ךָ֜","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Eccl 5 14","book":"Eccl","chapter":5,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/בֶּ֣טֶן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Eccl 11 5","book":"Eccl","chapter":11,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/בֶ֣טֶן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 3 3","book":"Ezek","chapter":3,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִּטְנְ/ךָ֤","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Gen 25 23","book":"Gen","chapter":25,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/בִטְנֵ֔/ךְ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp2fs"},{"reference":"Gen 25 24","book":"Gen","chapter":25,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/בִטְנָֽ/הּ","source":"he